Output demo/preview.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 24

Type "# skeletoni — cleanest SvelteKit setup"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "pnpm install"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "pnpm check"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "pnpm build"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Sleep 1s
